Scene summary: Hook: the director of a newly opened small hospital walks through a lobby where the waiting chairs are still wrapped in plastic; the hospital must face its first accreditation and the team has never been surveyed. The product does not appear. 9:16 vertical, realistic live-action, shot on a modern smartphone | Primary Video Type: UGC Native (RS baru/tipe D menghadapi akreditasi pertama, belum punya contoh dokumen sama sekali) + Supporting Format: Product Demo | Handheld walking medium shots through a brand-new small hospital lobby, then a bare new office; one close-up of plastic-wrapped waiting chairs; Seq 3 single static tripod medium shot at the office desk. REFERENCE PRIORITY: Use DNA Character as the authority for the talent's FACE and BODY identity only (not the outfit). Use DNA Product as the authority for the exact product identity. WARDROBE below overrides any outfit visible in the DNA Character image. CHARACTER LOCK: Use the DNA Character reference ONLY for the talent's face and body identity: exact face shape, jawline, skin tone, eye shape, eyebrows, hair or hijab style, body proportions and distinguishing features. Do NOT copy the outfit from the reference image; the outfit is defined in WARDROBE below. Keep the exact same face and body throughout the sequence. Do not add accessories or name tags not listed in WARDROBE. WARDROBE (OVERRIDES REFERENCE OUTFIT): Light blue long-sleeve dress shirt with sleeves rolled to the forearm, no tie, charcoal trousers, brown leather belt, brown shoes, black smartwatch. No white coat, no name tag, no lanyard, no logo. PRODUCT LOCK: Exact Paket Dokumen Inti Akreditasi Rumah Sakit STARKES 2026 package box from the DNA Product reference image (the real package box mockup uploaded as an ingredient). Preserve the exact box colors, title text, cover design, proportions and visible design details exactly as in the reference. Do NOT invent a different box design. It may appear with printed decree (SK) and SPO pages in plain folders, a printed document map table, and a laptop showing the package's Excel self-assessment (a long list of assessment rows with colored status cells and a bar chart per chapter). Do not redesign, simplify, recolor, or rebrand the box. SET & PROPS: Brand-new small hospital: a bright lobby with fresh pale paint, rows of waiting chairs still wrapped in plastic, an empty reception desk, a few unopened cardboard boxes; then a bare new office with a plain desk, a laptop and an empty bookshelf. Workers only as blurred shapes far away. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · close-up: plastic-wrapped waiting chairs; cut to medium shot as he stops in the lobby and looks to the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Rumah sakit kami baru buka." Delivery (EN): calm, matter-of-fact 2–4s Problem · medium shot, he gestures at the empty reception desk. VO (ID, verbatim): "Ini akreditasi pertama kami." Delivery (EN): honest 4–6s Problem · medium close-up, he walks slowly toward the office corridor. VO (ID, verbatim): "Tim belum pernah disurvei sama sekali." Delivery (EN): concerned 6–8s Problem · medium shot, he opens the door of a bare office with an empty bookshelf. VO (ID, verbatim): "Contoh dokumennya juga belum ada." Delivery (EN): worried but composed 8–10s Beat · medium shot, he walks into the bare office and sets his phone on the desk. VO: none. AUDIO: Echoey new lobby ambience, distant drilling, footsteps. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple,